/ Inside plang's own goals an "each goal" event doesn't run while event.setting.goal is app (the default): reading
/ %!error% three times shows plang's error goal each time, and "before each goal" runs Count once, for Loop alone. With
/ event.setting.goal all, it runs for each of plang's goals too: once for Loop and once for each read.
Start
- set %items% = [1, 2, 3]
- set %count% = 0
- before each goal, call Count
- call Loop
- assert %count% equals 1, "under app, plang's own goals run no each-goal event"
- set %!app.event.setting.goal% = "all"
- set %count% = 0
- call Loop
- assert %count% equals 4, "under all, each of plang's goals runs it too"

/ Reads %!error% once for each item.
Loop
- foreach %items%, call Read

/ One read of %!error%.
Read
- set %seen% = %!error%

/ The event's call.
Count
- set %count% = %count% + 1
